OL,3,A'Maxxing' selected as Dictionary.com
OL,4,Aword of the year
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmericans have gone all in on
OL,7,F"maxxing", making it the 2026 Word of
OL,8,Fthe Year for Dictionary.com.
OL,10,FShort for maximising, the term "can be
OL,11,Fused on its own or added to the end of
OL,12,Fany word to convey you're doing
OL,13,Fsomething to the fullest or optimizing
OL,14,Fit as much as possible", Dictionary.com
OL,15,Fsaid in a statement.
OL,17,FIt's a major departure from two years
OL,18,Fago, when the site, after analysing US
OL,19,Fsocial media trends, news stories, and
OL,20,Fsearch data, chose demure as word of
OL,21,Fthe year. Last year's was "67".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
