OL,3,A'Maxxing' selected as Dictionary.com
OL,4,Aword of the year
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Maxxing is the linguistic
OL,7,Fmanifestation of a culture increasingly
OL,8,Fpreoccupied with getting the most out
OL,9,Fof everything," said Steve Johnson,
OL,10,Fdirector of lexicography for the
OL,11,FDictionary Media Group.
